Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:16:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] Titan 2: SystemUI unlock service for the rear screen

Titan2RearUnlockService lets RearShell (CONTROL_KEYGUARD) query the lock, dismiss it when no
input is needed and unlock with the PIN/pattern, checked like the bouncer does (LockSettings,
failed attempts, lockout). A SIM PIN/PUK, secure lock device or a device admin secondary lock
screen leave both paths unavailable, as the bouncer would still ask for them. The keyguard
presentation is not shown on the rear display: the shell draws its own lock screen there.
